# AOS v7.0 — gitignore (keeps the published repo lean; local copies stay untouched)
# Third-party reference-only skills library (full external git clone, thousands of files).
# PROFESSIONAL INTEGRATION PATH: track it as a submodule instead of ignoring it:
#   git submodule add https://github.com/anthropics/skills.git .agent/06-templates/claude-skills
#   (then delete this ignore line). Consumers clone with: git clone --recurse-submodules <repo-url>
# Rule: never load or index its internals from AOS workflows (see .agent/INDEX.md).
.agent/06-templates/claude-skills/
# Python bytecode caches (regenerable)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Local machine notes (never commit machine-specific paths)
*.local.md
